* [33mcommit c1f5209b7f60d0508d7004800377e79c869bfa4f[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Thu Sep 24 03:17:31 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Fetch kvit-ui from its public repository
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     The submodule's address was a directory on the machine the editor is
[31m|[m     developed on, so a clone made anywhere else could not initialize
[31m|[m     third_party/kvit-ui and could not build. It is now the public repository.
[31m|[m     A checkout that already initialized the submodule keeps the address it
[31m|[m     recorded then, in its own .git/config, and goes on fetching from there.
[31m|[m     
