* [33mcommit 2105614568dcc8621e3fadf25688554f6edf81fc[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Wed Sep 23 22:11:35 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Let a host turn off the picture panel, and give the read-only view the vault's folders
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     A message box has no use for the panel that edits a focused picture's path
[31m|[m     and alt text: the path is a file the box named itself, and the Enter that
[31m|[m     saves one of the panel's fields is ignored by the field and reaches a host
[31m|[m     that sends on Enter, so saving the alt text would also send the message.
[31m|[m     BlockEditorSurface.showImageEditPanel, forwarded by CompactEditor, turns the
[31m|[m     panel off. With it off, a click on a picture opens the lightbox without
[31m|[m     first moving the keyboard onto the picture. The click did that only so the
[31m|[m     panel would be open when the lightbox closed, and it left the next
[31m|[m     Backspace deleting the picture.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     DocumentView gave its editor only the note's own folder, so a picture named
[31m|[m     from the vault's root (assets/a.png in a note inside a subfolder) or from a
[31m|[m     website's root (/images/a.png) drew the broken placeholder while the note
[31m|[m     itself showed it. It now takes assetRoot and siteRoot, both the open
[31m|[m     vault's by default, with siteRoot being the vault's site folder inside
[31m|[m     assetRoot, so a host drawing a file from a copy of the vault names the copy
[31m|[m     once.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     tests/test_embeddededitor.cpp and tests/test_documentview.cpp cover both;
[31m|[m     each new case fails without its change.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
[31m|[m     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01V9RRd57FzWCDfmicTRw2UA
