* [33mcommit 4451e0073ea71eafc10c7cec755f307b92616a38[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Wed Sep 23 17:02:36 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Grow a list with Enter and send from any block with Ctrl+Enter
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     In a CompactEditor that submits on Enter, a list item keeps Enter for
[31m|[m     the list: it makes the next item, as in a document, since Shift+Enter
[31m|[m     is the continuation line and there is no other way to grow it. Enter
[31m|[m     on the empty item leaves the list, and Enter on the paragraph after
[31m|[m     that sends.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Ctrl+Enter is reported from every block, list and code included, so a
[31m|[m     host that took Enter for itself always has one key that reaches it.
[31m|[m     With Enter given back to the editor it stays the code block's way out.
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m  qml/BlockEditorSurface.qml    |  6 [32m++[m[31m-[m
[31m|[m  qml/CompactEditor.qml         | 16 [32m++++[m[31m----[m
[31m|[m  qml/EditableBlock.qml         | 23 [32m+++++++++++[m[31m-[m
