* [33mcommit 846ecb9993f592379e409e5b8277457346ce3ba8[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Wed Sep 23 14:11:36 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Pin kvit-ui at the popover keyboard fix
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     kvit-ui 0a0b210 makes KvitPopover leave the keyboard where the reader put
[31m|[m     it while the popover was fading out, rather than letting Qt move it back
[31m|[m     at the end of the fade. The two commits before it change only kvit-ui's
[31m|[m     own build.sh. Nothing here loads KvitPopover yet; the pin moves so that
[31m|[m     kvit-works, which must pin the same kvit-ui commit as this editor, can
[31m|[m     take the fix.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
