* [33mcommit 09d366fd1f82e1a490872c3382d2ec4423b5fc29[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Mon Sep 21 22:23:43 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Leave the wheel alone where there is nothing to scroll
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     An editor embedded as a box that grows with its content — the read-only
[31m|[m     document surface, the message-box editor — is as tall as its document,
[31m|[m     so its list has nothing to scroll and the wheel over it belongs to
[31m|[m     whatever the host put it inside. The wheel handler already knew that and
[31m|[m     declined those events by setting `accepted` false in its signal.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Declining is not enough. A pointer handler that is enabled takes the
[31m|[m     event out of the delivery that would otherwise have reached the host's
[31m|[m     own scrolling view, and setting `accepted` false in the signal does not
[31m|[m     put it back: measured in a host that puts the surface inside its own
[31m|[m     ScrollView over a document twice the height of the pane, five notches of
[31m|[m     the wheel moved the pane nothing at all, and the same five notches moved
[31m|[m     it 72 px with the handler disabled.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     So the handler is disabled outright when the list it belongs to has
[31m|[m     nothing to scroll, rather than enabled and declining. The signal keeps
[31m|[m     its modifier check, which is a different question: Ctrl+wheel is the
[31m|[m     reading size and belongs to whoever handles that.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     tests/test_documentview.cpp asserts the handler is disabled over a
[31m|[m     surface that grew with its document. It is the handler's own state
[31m|[m     rather than a wheel event's effect because the editor's suite has no
[31m|[m     host around the surface to scroll.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
[31m|[m     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01NkdCZYLXxCwj1wuX4dZwLW
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m  qml/WheelScroller.qml       | 14 [32m+++++++++++++[m[31m-[m
[31m|[m  tests/test_documentview.cpp | 33 [32m+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++[m
[31m|[m  2 files changed, 46 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
