[31m|[m  qml/BlockEditor.qml       |  26 [32m++++[m
[31m|[m  qml/DocumentScrollBar.qml |   9 [32m++[m
[31m|[m  qml/WheelScroller.qml     | 228 [32m++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++[m
[31m|[m  4 files changed, 264 insertions(+)
[31m|[m 
* [33mcommit e6bd6f7e702505aa0c8f5cc1dcd338d357df5578[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Mon Sep 21 17:35:40 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Draw a picture at its own width from the file header
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     An image block with no stored width took the width to draw at from the
[31m|[m     loaded image while the decode request was taken from the width drawn,
[31m|[m     which QML reports as a binding loop and breaks by refusing to
[31m|[m     re-evaluate, at a width that depends on evaluation order. Each pass
[31m|[m     around the circle re-decoded the file.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     ImageAssets.naturalSize() measures the file header with QImageReader
[31m|[m     and remembers it per path until timestamp or length changes; drawn and
[31m|[m     decoded widths both come from it, and the read-only picture uses it too
[31m|[m     so SVGs agree between pane and editor.
[31m|[m 
