* [33mcommit c57fd321ad1f0151f214c3a8548d4cf1e6306e31[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <skolos@yahoo.com>
[31m|[m Date:   Fri Sep 18 18:11:43 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Take the shared build settings
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     build.sh now sources ~/kvit-build/kvit-build-env.sh when it is there and passes
[31m|[m     what it reports to the configure step. The four other Kvit repositories on this
[31m|[m     machine already do, and this one matters most of the five, because two of them
[31m|[m     compile it as a subdirectory: its 132 translation units are compiled three
[31m|[m     times here.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     What it brings: ccache in front of the compiler, mold as the linker, -gz=zlib
[31m|[m     on every compile and link, QT_SKIP_DEFAULT_TESTCASE_DIRS,
[31m|[m     CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS, and link-time optimization held explicitly off.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     QT_SKIP_DEFAULT_TESTCASE_DIRS is the one worth understanding rather than just
[31m|[m     taking. Qt attaches QT_TESTCASE_SOURCEDIR and QT_TESTCASE_BUILDDIR to every
[31m|[m     target linking Qt6::Test, as an interface compile definition in
[31m|[m     Qt6TestTargets.cmake, and both hold absolute paths -- 201 compile edges each
[31m|[m     here, which no compiler cache can serve in a second checkout. Qt guards them
[31m|[m     with a target property that CMake 3.23 and later initialize from a plain
[31m|[m     variable of the same name, which is what the shared file sets. What they exist
[31m|[m     for is QFINDTESTDATA, which falls back to the recorded source and build
[31m|[m     directories when it cannot find a file beside the executable, and no test in
[31m|[m     any of the five repositories calls it.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Nothing depends on the file being there. Absent it, this configures without it
[31m|[m     and builds exactly as before, which is what keeps the repository buildable for
[31m|[m     continuous integration, for Flathub and on Windows.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
[31m|[m     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjxbTveoNxvbkFbwhtQikk
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m  build.sh | 24 [32m+++++++++++++++++++++++[m[31m-[m
[31m|[m  1 file changed, 23 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
