* [33mcommit 446babc2538caae411a74c7f01bf03970efc445b[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <skolos@yahoo.com>
[31m|[m Date:   Fri Sep 18 18:11:25 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Take the absolute paths off the compile commands
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     A compiler cache such as ccache decides whether it has compiled a file before
[31m|[m     by hashing the compiler, the whole argument list and the contents of every file
[31m|[m     the compile reads. It rewrites the arguments it recognises as paths -- -I,
[31m|[m     -isystem, -include, the input file -- to paths relative to the working
[31m|[m     directory before hashing, so that two checkouts of the same commit at different
[31m|[m     paths produce one cache entry rather than two. It cannot rewrite a path inside
[31m|[m     a macro value, because nothing tells it that one is a path. One such macro
[31m|[m     therefore defeats the cache for every translation unit that sees it.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     571 of this repository's 651 compile edges had one, and the number matters more
[31m|[m     than it looks, because two other projects build this repository as a
[31m|[m     subdirectory: the same definitions reached 586 of 713 compile edges in one and
[31m|[m     387 of 540 in the other.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     KVIT_MATH_RES_ROOT was 554 of them. It was a PUBLIC compile definition on the
[31m|[m     microtex target, so it reached everything that links the vendored math engine,
[31m|[m     and only MathRenderer::resourceRoot() ever read it. It is now set on that one
[31m|[m     source file. Nothing about how the path resolves changed -- the same value
[31m|[m     reaches the same function, the KVIT_MATH_RES environment variable still
[31m|[m     overrides it, and `kvit-notes --math-selftest` reports the same resource root as
[31m|[m     before -- but one compile command holds an absolute path rather than five
[31m|[m     hundred.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     KVIT_SOURCE_ROOT and KVIT_TEST_FIXTURES were 16 between them. They now reach
[31m|[m     every test in tests/ through CTest's ENVIRONMENT property, applied in the loop
[31m|[m     at the end of tests/CMakeLists.txt that already labels each test, so a test
[31m|[m     added later gets them without anyone remembering to ask. KvitTestPaths in
[31m|[m     tests/testpaths.h reads them, and each falls back to a path relative to the
[31m|[m     test binary's own directory, so a test run by hand needs no environment.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     What is left is the one edge on mathrenderer.cpp.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Suite: 107 of 110 pass. The three that do not are processor-time budgets and
[31m|[m     are unrelated: NoteCollectionTests measures 2624 ms against a 2000 ms ceiling
[31m|[m     where the unchanged tree measures 2631 ms, the formula-caret case in
[31m|[m     IntegrationTestsIsolated measures 36.5 ms against a 16 ms ceiling where the
[31m|[m     unchanged tree measures 36.1 ms, and a third varies between CollectionSearchTests
[31m|[m     and PerformanceOpsTests and passes when run on its own.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
[31m|[m     Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EjxbTveoNxvbkFbwhtQikk
