[31m|[m  tests/test_diagramrepair.cpp        |  5 [32m++[m[31m-[m
[31m|[m  tests/test_mathrenderer.cpp         | 13 [32m++[m[31m-----[m
[31m|[m  tests/testpaths.h                   | 55 [32m+++++++++++++++++++++++++++[m
