* [33mcommit 418a0305f3e20502b126db34bb36d0d01c581061[m
[31m|[m Author: kvit-s <info@kvit.app>
[31m|[m Date:   Sun Sep 13 12:55:53 2026 -0500
[31m|[m 
[31m|[m     Drop the note list's rows when the vault they name closes
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     NoteListModel coalesced every collection change through a 20 ms timer,
[31m|[m     including the one a root change causes. For that interval the model kept
[31m|[m     advertising rows naming notes in the vault just closed, and the collection
[31m|[m     could answer nothing about any of them: data() looked each row's relative
[31m|[m     path up, found no entry, and returned a default QVariant for every role.
[31m|[m     Anything that painted in that window drew rows with a blank title, a blank
[31m|[m     snippet, no date and a word count of zero.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Nothing reported it. Qt.formatDateTime used to refuse the empty string a
[31m|[m     `string` property produced, and 708ebac correctly declared the delegate's
[31m|[m     created and modified as `date`, after which an invalid QDateTime formats to
[31m|[m     nothing in silence. So the rows go with the vault, and the claim is now held
[31m|[m     by assertions rather than by a console message:
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     - rootChanged rebuilds at once rather than scheduling. There is nothing to
[31m|[m       coalesce there, because opening or closing a vault is one deliberate act
[31m|[m       rather than the stream of filesystem events the timer exists for.
[31m|[m       revisionChanged keeps the timer.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     - data() stays tolerant of a row whose entry has gone, since deleting a note
[31m|[m       drops it from the collection while the rows stand until the next rebuild,
[31m|[m       but every role now answers in the type the delegate declares for it and the
[31m|[m       path role returns the row's own path. A role that returns a default
[31m|[m       QVariant reaches QML as `undefined`, which a required `date`, `int` or
[31m|[m       `bool` property cannot take, and the title falls back to the file name so
[31m|[m       such a row names its note instead of drawing as an empty line.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Four claims are covered. tests/test_notelistmodel.cpp asserts that
[31m|[m     closeRoot() empties the model in the same call rather than 20 ms later, that
[31m|[m     a switch to another vault lands on that vault's notes and only those, that
[31m|[m     several notes written in quick succession are still one rebuild rather than
[31m|[m     one per file, and that a row whose note has gone answers in type.
[31m|[m     tests/tst_uiremediation.qml makes the first two of those at the pane, reached
[31m|[m     by object name.
[31m|[m     
[31m|[m     Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
